         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nEarlier, we learned that when we compare numbers we can use the equal symbol (=) to say that two things are equal. We also learned that when we change one side of an equality, we must change the other side in the same proportion so that the equality stays true.\n\nBut equality is not the only comparison we can make. In this class, we will learn about two more comparisons: the greater and the smaller.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "11d4f426-bf84-40b8-acb8-a0f61e47a778",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "11d4f426-bf84-40b8-acb8-a0f61e47a778",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "0fe4b20d-1bd5-4f36-9d0b-87c10881ff8d",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=0fe4b20d-1bd5-4f36-9d0b-87c10881ff8d",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### A Ruler\n\nA ruler is a rectangle with marks. The long marks carry the numbers 0, 10, 20, and so on up to 100, while the shorter marks between them stand for the values in between.\n\nNotice that the marks are always the same distance apart from each other.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "A centesimal scale, that is, a ruler with marks from 0 to 100.",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/HistoryTracers/Meter.jpg\" class=\"imgcenter\"/>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "A centesimal scale, that is, a ruler with marks from 0 to 100.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Figure 1: A centesimal scale. The long marks carry the tens, and the shorter marks stand for the values in between.*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
